{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"一开始有一种强烈而郑重的向往，带着几分兴奋和笃定；随后渐渐变得柔软、珍惜，却始终没有完全踏实下来。热切和悬而未定的期待同时存在。\",\n  \"thread\": \"他还没有真正得到自己向往的幸福，却已经感到它对自己有多重要，所以这份渴望一开始就毫不含糊。但越是在乎，越不能把想要当成已经拥有。最初的激动过去后，那份吸引并没有减弱，只是变成了更温柔、更不敢轻易认定的期待。\",\n  \"used\": \"无\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"有一种尚未得到的幸福已经真切地吸引着他，让他无法把它当作可有可无的东西。\",\n    \"他对这份幸福的向往很强烈，但向往本身还不能使他感到真正的满足和安定。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b3be5f6e-847a-4a2e-b53c-ca452810d7db", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215534089844Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.609, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T21:56:34.717603+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "36c9729a8c254836760e731eace54351ce44c153cafddf3939aec275bd7e6470", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence"